{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19100","headline":"衢州徐员外使君遗以缟紵兼竹书箱因成一篇用答佳贶 · 刘禹锡","name":"衢州徐员外使君遗以缟紵兼竹书箱因成一篇用答佳贶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂柯山下旧仙郎，列宿来添婺女光。\n远放歌声分白紵，知传家学与青箱。\n水朝沧海何时去，兰在幽林亦自芳。\n闻说天台有遗爱，人将琪树比甘棠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}